---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<div class="min-h-screen bg-black flex flex-col justify-center items-center px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-md w-full space-y-8 text-center">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="mt-6 text-9xl font-extrabold text-yellow-400">404</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-400">Página no existe</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white">Lo sentimos, no pudimos encontrar lo que estás buscando.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="inset-0 justify-center items-center text-center p-10">
        <a href="/"><button class="font-poppins bg-black text-white hover:text-yellow-400 px-6 py-3 rounded-none border-yellow-400 border-4 font-medium text-2xl transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:scale-110">
            Ir a inicio
        </button></a>
    </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-16 w-full max-w-2xl">
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="w-full border-t border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative flex justify-center">
          <span class="px-2 bg-black text-sm text-white font-bold">
            Si cree que esto es un error, comuníquese con el servicio de asistencia.
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>